# Wave W17-AC (Route 226): east pine — a cliff pine in deep sea-greens, tiered and wind-kept, its highlight lifted clear of the turf, on east turf (ground baked in). Route 226’s own tree — split from Route 221’s tide pine by depth entire (cliff-deep green vs marsh blue-green) and from Route 225’s zone pine by stance: this crown is full over the sea wind, that one sparse over scorched ground.
